@startuml
title Device & IoT Connectivity Service — Code Diagram (To Be)

top to bottom direction

class DeviceHandler {
  +RegisterRoutes(router: RouterGroup): void
  +ListDevices(ctx: RequestContext): Response
  +RegisterDevice(ctx: RequestContext): Response
  +UpdateDevice(ctx: RequestContext): Response
  +DeleteDevice(ctx: RequestContext): Response
}
class DeviceService {
  +ListDevices(houseID: UUID): []Device
  +RegisterDevice(userID: UUID, request: DeviceRequest): Device
  +UpdateDevice(userID: UUID, deviceID: UUID, request: DeviceRequest): Device
  +DeleteDevice(userID: UUID, deviceID: UUID): error
}
class DeviceRepository {
  +FindByHouse(houseID: UUID): []Device
  +Save(device: Device): Device
  +Delete(deviceID: UUID): error
}
class MQTTAdapter {
  +Provision(device: Device): error
  +PublishCommand(deviceID: UUID, command: DeviceCommand): error
  +SubscribeTelemetry(): Channel~TelemetryMessage~
}
class Device {
  +UUID id
  +UUID houseID
  +string name
  +DeviceType type
  +DeviceStatus status
}

DeviceHandler --> DeviceService : calls
DeviceService --> DeviceRepository : persists
DeviceService --> MQTTAdapter : provisions / sends commands
DeviceRepository ..> Device : stores
MQTTAdapter ..> Device : addresses
@enduml
